OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson to be sentenced for child sex
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former leader of the Democratic
OL,8,FUnionist Party (DUP), Jeffrey
OL,9,FDonaldson, is due to be sentenced for a
OL,10,Fseries of child sex offences, including
OL,11,Frape
OL,13,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,14,Fcounts of sex abuse, which he committed
OL,15,Fagainst two women when they were
OL,16,Fchildren
OL,18,FThe 63-year-old - who was an MP for 27
OL,19,Fyears - was stripped of his knighthood
OL,20,Fby the King in July
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
