OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson to be sentenced for child sex
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing his conviction, the DUP and
OL,8,Fthe Ulster Unionists launched separate
OL,9,Fsafeguarding reviews into his time in
OL,10,Fboth parties
OL,12,FDonaldson, who has been held in
OL,13,FMaghaberry Prison while awaiting
OL,14,Fsentencing, is seeking to appeal
OL,15,Fagainst his convictions
OL,17,FHis wife Eleanor Donaldson faced a
OL,18,F"trial of the facts" on mental health
OL,19,Fgrounds, relating to five charges,
OL,20,Fincluding four related to aiding and
OL,21,Fabetting
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
